                        @L["The part you only notice when something goes wrong — and then it matters more than anything else."]
                    </div>
                    <div style="margin-top:6px;">
                        <span class="feature-pill">@L["&#128269; Who did what, and when"]</span>
                        <span class="feature-pill">@L["&#128683; Voided bills are never deleted"]</span>
                        <span class="feature-pill">@L["&#128190; Automatic daily backup"]</span>
